# Trivy CVE ignore list — reviewed and assessed as non-applicable
# Format: CVE-ID [expiry] [reason]

# starlette: StaticFiles SSRF via UNC paths — aigent-squad does not serve static files
CVE-2026-48818

# starlette: request.form() multipart limits ignored — aigent-squad accepts no form uploads
CVE-2026-54283

# wheel: CVE fixed by Dockerfile upgrade (pip install --upgrade wheel>=0.46.2);
# Trivy reads build-stage metadata, not the upgraded runtime venv entry
CVE-2026-24049

# mcp DNS rebinding: affects MCP Server only — aigent-squad uses mcp as a CLIENT
CVE-2025-66416

# starlette: Range header DoS — requires FastAPI upgrade; tracked separately
CVE-2025-62727

# jaraco.context: transitive dep of setuptools>=79 which re-pins to 5.x;
# not used directly by app code — cannot override without breaking setuptools
CVE-2026-23949
